Then, by using point slope form. <math>y-y_{1}=m(x-x_{1})</math>. We can say that the equation for <math>EH</math> is <math>y-7=-\frac{4}{3}(x-4)</math> or in this case, <math>y=-\frac{4}{3}x+12 \frac{1}{3}</math>.

