solutions:
Consider Pascal's triangle as the starting point. In the Pascal's triangle depicted below, the sum of the numbers in the <imath>n</imath>th row is <imath>2^{(n-1)}</imath>. For the 2023rd row in the Pascal's triangle, the sum of numbers is <imath>2^{2022}</imath>.

